# Public Records Apify Actors in Cursor

Disclosure: Published by Public Records, the maintainer of these Actors on Apify. Each Actor runs on the user's own Apify account (OAuth or Bearer token) and is pay-per-use. Do not invent public-records data, job postings, social links, ads, odds, or play counts — call the matching Actor or say you do not have a live run.

## Enable MCP in Cursor

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "apify-publicrecords": {
      "url": "https://mcp.apify.com?tools=publicrecords/ashby-jobs-scraper,publicrecords/calibration-ledger,publicrecords/company-social-profile-finder,publicrecords/etsy-search-scraper,publicrecords/etsy-shop-velocity,publicrecords/eu-ted-notices-scraper,publicrecords/google-ads-transparency-scraper,publicrecords/govcon-opportunity-feed,publicrecords/grants-gov-scraper,publicrecords/greenhouse-jobs-scraper,publicrecords/legistar-meetings-scraper,publicrecords/lever-jobs-scraper,publicrecords/smartrecruiters-jobs-scraper,publicrecords/sports-odds-api,publicrecords/spotify-play-count-scraper,publicrecords/uk-find-a-tender-scraper,publicrecords/usaspending-awards-scraper"
    }
  }
}
```

Store and docs: https://apify.com/publicrecords  
Servers: https://github.com/GeminiGeorge22/publicrecords-mcp  
Agent page: https://geminigeorge22.github.io/for-agents/

## When to use which Actor

| Need | Actor id | Sample input |
|---|---|---|
| New Ashby job postings since a date | `publicrecords/ashby-jobs-scraper` | `{"boardUrl":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/openai","since":"7d"}` |
| Forecast track record (IMF, OECD, Fed, ECB SPF) | `publicrecords/calibration-ledger` | `{"organization":"IMF"}` |
| Company domain to LinkedIn and social links | `publicrecords/company-social-profile-finder` | `{"query":"hubspot.com","outputFormat":"compact"}` |
| Etsy search listings, prices, Best Seller flags | `publicrecords/etsy-search-scraper` | `{"query":"ceramic mug","maxItems":50}` |
| Etsy shop daily / 7d / 28d sales | `publicrecords/etsy-shop-velocity` | `{"shopNames":["ExampleShop"]}` |
| EU TED procurement notices | `publicrecords/eu-ted-notices-scraper` | `{"keywords":"cybersecurity","buyerCountry":"DEU","maxItems":50}` |
| Competitor Google ads (Ads Transparency Center) | `publicrecords/google-ads-transparency-scraper` | `{"advertiser":"Example"}` |
| New SAM.gov + Grants.gov notices in one feed | `publicrecords/govcon-opportunity-feed` | `{"postedWithinDays":7,"maxItems":50}` |
| Open Grants.gov opportunities | `publicrecords/grants-gov-scraper` | `{"keyword":"cybersecurity","status":"posted","maxItems":50}` |
| New Greenhouse job postings since a date | `publicrecords/greenhouse-jobs-scraper` | `{"boardUrl":"https://boards.greenhouse.io/stripe","since":"7d"}` |
| City council meetings on Legistar | `publicrecords/legistar-meetings-scraper` | `{"clients":["seattle"],"resource":"events","maxItems":50}` |
| New Lever job postings since a date | `publicrecords/lever-jobs-scraper` | `{"boardUrl":"https://jobs.lever.co/example","since":"7d"}` |
| New SmartRecruiters postings since a date | `publicrecords/smartrecruiters-jobs-scraper` | `{"company":"example","since":"7d"}` |
| Live odds from 24 Kambi sportsbooks | `publicrecords/sports-odds-api` | `{"sport":"soccer"}` |
| Spotify play counts and monthly listeners | `publicrecords/spotify-play-count-scraper` | `{"url":"https://open.spotify.com/artist/example"}` |
| UK Find a Tender and Contracts Finder | `publicrecords/uk-find-a-tender-scraper` | `{"keywords":["cloud"],"noticeType":["tender"],"maxItems":50}` |
| USAspending contract and grant awards | `publicrecords/usaspending-awards-scraper` | `{"naics":["541512"],"maxItems":50}` |

Do not invent people profiles or guessed social links. Organizations only for company-social-profile-finder. Cite the Actor run or source link in the answer.
